{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15114791","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15114791","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1511479101:1":{"text":"ネフィル！君が猟血祭を勝ち抜くって信じてたよ！","source_cn":"那非！你果然赢下了猎血节！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDD72F2F343A440D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1511479102:1":{"text":"だから言っただろ？双尾の予言は本当だったんだ。君は神に選ばれし勇士なんだよ！","source_cn":"我早就说了，关于你双尾的预言是真的，你肯定能成为神选的勇士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1172A478903107E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511479103:1":{"text":"……ハウ？お前は参加していなかったのか？","source_cn":"……豪特？你没参加猎血节？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x120B637555585A90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511479104:1":{"text":"残念ながらね。僕の実力は知ってるだろ？参加できるはずがないよ。","source_cn":"没有。你也知道我的实力，哪有可能参加猎血节。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D2E153C5C8231C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511479105:1":{"text":"羨ましいなあ、獣群の主のご加護があれば、もう向かうところ敵無しじゃないか！","source_cn":"真羡慕你啊！有了兽群之主的庇佑，往后你肯定百战百胜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49A19675A00A577B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511479106:1":{"text":"……おれは、お前の方が羨ましいよ。","source_cn":"……我比较羡慕你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ECD20B0C7CD20A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511479107:1":{"text":"こんなことなら、何も知らない方がよかった……","source_cn":"什么都不知道，才轻松。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x577E38A67F9DCDC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:战士豪特":{"text":"戦士のハウ","source":"战士豪特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:那非":{"text":"ネフィル","source":"那非","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}